  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f4bc1e501651d89",
      "translationZh": "大多数编程智能体框架依赖庞大的 Python 技术栈、复杂的图处理库或云端编排器。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fca40affa1701632",
      "translationZh": "我想要的是一种完全在本地 POSIX 环境中运行、支持多种 CLI（Claude Code、Codex、OpenCode、Gemini CLI），且外部 npm 依赖为零（node_modules = 0）的方案。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d039b48d07d8eaf",
      "translationZh": "以下是这种模块化架构的内部工作原理：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "702847407bf03b1b",
      "translationZh": "已解决的关键架构问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1e3521e830fc9392",
      "translationZh": "Gate-2 内容哈希检查：LLM 编程进程经常以退出码 0 正常退出，却悄无声息地拒绝执行或做出 0 处修改。引擎在执行前后对仓库哈希值进行快照，以便立即识别虚假的通过结果，防止出现实际上未完成却显示完成的情况。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "128eab8e4bb159c5",
      "translationZh": "基于波次的 DAG（wave_parser.js、wave.js）：任务在磁盘上的 markdown 表格中定义。解析器提取依赖关系，并将相互独立的任务安排到并行执行波次中（Wave A、Wave B）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3107df4cead33e71",
      "translationZh": "双层验证（任务级与项目级）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc0a6ba6c1a23346",
      "translationZh": "任务级：/wbValid 和 /wbReview 使用一个独立模型，对各个任务的差异进行测试和评分。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "92a3da476f284cae",
      "translationZh": "项目级：/wbAudit 对整个代码库或软件包执行纵向审计，全面评估架构的完整性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "124336785d01f369",
      "translationZh": "动态模型路由与自定义链：为每个角色配置回退链（例如 WORKER=qwen,gpt-5 和 VALIDATOR=claude,gemini）。它将机械性的样板代码工作路由给便宜、快速的模型，同时将强推理模型留给规划和对抗性审查。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6a61ca48b663fdef",
      "translationZh": "具有明确停止条件的循环（--loop）：不同于那些无休止地兜圈子、消耗 token 的自主循环，这种循环会在满足停止条件时确定性地退出：所有任务均被标记为有效、遇到依赖项阻塞，或 /wbAudit 之类的纵向检查达到目标分数（例如 >= 8/10）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "83dd6e0563c44346",
      "translationZh": "用动作代替人设：工作流不会要求智能体“扮演安全工程师”，而是运行明确、确定性的命令：/wbStandup、/wbSecure、/wbContext、/wbRelease 和 /wbPublish。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a993d45ff631303",
      "translationZh": "整个核心仅依靠原生 Node.js 运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a6a07f9aab1768c9",
      "translationZh": "（完整的架构流程图和 GitHub 仓库链接会放在下方第一条评论里！）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1ad043c21136fefb",
      "translationZh": "欢迎提问，我很乐意解答有关波次调度、停止条件或模型链的问题！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
